1
00:00:03,003 --> 00:00:04,046
KAKITANGAN SAHAJA

2
00:00:06,382 --> 00:00:08,426
Jangan mengarutlah!

3
00:00:09,135 --> 00:00:12,262
Awak pasti juga raksasa!

4
00:00:12,263 --> 00:00:13,514
Kondo!

5
00:00:18,769 --> 00:00:20,520
Hei, awak buat apa?

6
00:00:20,521 --> 00:00:24,942
Keluarga Ashihara. Kalian pun sama?
Jangan dekat!

7
00:02:02,331 --> 00:02:03,998
{\an8}DEVILS' CREST

8
00:02:03,999 --> 00:02:08,170
{\an8}EPISOD 4: CURIGA

9
00:02:09,755 --> 00:02:11,631
Awak cakap apa ini, Gamo?

10
00:02:11,632 --> 00:02:14,008
Kenapa awak fikir kami raksasa?

11
00:02:14,009 --> 00:02:16,636
Tiada penjelasan lain!

12
00:02:16,637 --> 00:02:19,807
Awak bunuh makhluk besar itu, bukan?

13
00:02:20,391 --> 00:02:23,768
Hanya raksasa yang mampu membunuhnya.

14
00:02:23,769 --> 00:02:27,230
Ada orang yang tercedera
di dalam kawasan perintang.

15
00:02:27,231 --> 00:02:28,941
Saya takkan benarkan awak masuk!

16
00:02:29,567 --> 00:02:33,152
Baik kita berunding dengan Ohno.

17
00:02:33,153 --> 00:02:34,821
Saya tahu muslihat awak.

18
00:02:34,822 --> 00:02:37,615
Awak akan bertukar bentuk seperti Watamaki

19
00:02:37,616 --> 00:02:39,577
dan serang kami, bukan?

20
00:02:42,788 --> 00:02:47,625
Ohno, awak lihat Watamaki bertukar?

21
00:02:47,626 --> 00:02:49,168
Ya, saya nampak.

22
00:02:49,169 --> 00:02:51,422
Semua orang nampak kejadian itu.

23
00:02:51,922 --> 00:02:54,341
Watamaki keluar dari Caliculus,

24
00:02:54,884 --> 00:02:56,802
bertukar menjadi raksasa tanpa wajah,

25
00:02:57,344 --> 00:02:59,346
lalu menyerang Beroshi.

26
00:02:59,930 --> 00:03:01,098
Adakah kalian...

27
00:03:01,807 --> 00:03:03,851
Awak biarkan Beroshi mati begitu saja?

28
00:03:04,935 --> 00:03:08,606
Kondo, diam.
Awak tak tahu apa yang berlaku.

29
00:03:09,189 --> 00:03:11,608
Tada dan Aida cedera parah di kedai

30
00:03:11,609 --> 00:03:14,319
akibat perbuatan Watamaki.

31
00:03:14,320 --> 00:03:18,072
<i>Jika Beroshi tiada di situ,
pasti lebih ramai yang terkorban.</i>

32
00:03:18,073 --> 00:03:20,451
<i>Dia mempertaruhkan nyawanya
demi menyelamatkan kita.</i>

33
00:03:20,951 --> 00:03:23,495
<i>Tiada pilihan! Kami terpaksa lari!</i>

34
00:03:24,079 --> 00:03:27,498
Kemudian kami bergegas ke lobi,

35
00:03:27,499 --> 00:03:31,003
tapi kami melihat raksasa gergasi itu
sedang mengamuk.

36
00:03:34,632 --> 00:03:36,424
<i>Kami bawa Tada dan Aida ke sini</i>

37
00:03:36,425 --> 00:03:39,303
<i>dan hampir tak sempat masuk ke kedai ini.</i>

38
00:03:39,887 --> 00:03:41,054
<i>Gamo betul.</i>

39
00:03:41,055 --> 00:03:44,475
<i>Manusia biasa tak mampu lawan
makhluk sebesar itu.</i>

40
00:03:45,392 --> 00:03:50,605
Selagi awak tidak buktikan
awak manusia seperti kami,

41
00:03:50,606 --> 00:03:52,650
kami takkan benarkan awak lalu.

42
00:03:53,692 --> 00:03:56,320
Kami bukan sahaja lawan
raksasa kepala tajam itu.

43
00:03:57,613 --> 00:03:59,948
Kami juga menumpaskan Watamaki

44
00:03:59,949 --> 00:04:01,825
sewaktu menjumpainya di Bilik Permainan.

45
00:04:02,409 --> 00:04:07,831
Kami juga kebumikan Miura
di dalam Caliculus.

46
00:04:10,459 --> 00:04:11,585
Beroshi...

47
00:04:12,211 --> 00:04:13,462
Dia dah mati?

48
00:04:23,472 --> 00:04:24,431
Beroshi...

49
00:04:25,432 --> 00:04:27,308
Hei, kembar lelaki...

50
00:04:27,309 --> 00:04:30,312
Lupakan pasal itu.
Apa maksud awak "menumpaskan"?

51
00:04:33,023 --> 00:04:35,734
Lupakan pasal itu?

52
00:04:36,443 --> 00:04:38,861
Apa awak buat pada Watamaki?

53
00:04:38,862 --> 00:04:41,447
Jangan cakap awak bunuh dia!

54
00:04:41,448 --> 00:04:42,992
Kami tak bunuh Watamaki.

55
00:04:43,492 --> 00:04:46,203
Tapi tak mudah

56
00:04:47,579 --> 00:04:49,706
untuk jelaskan perkara kami buat.

57
00:04:49,707 --> 00:04:52,208
Jangan mengarut. Saya dah agak. Kalian...

58
00:04:52,209 --> 00:04:54,003
Gamo, diamlah!

59
00:05:00,092 --> 00:05:04,095
Apa itu? Saya ketua kelas.

60
00:05:04,096 --> 00:05:06,765
Awak yang patut diam!

61
00:05:15,858 --> 00:05:17,775
Tak guna jadi ketua kelas.

62
00:05:17,776 --> 00:05:20,611
Semasa Beroshi diserang oleh Watamaki,

63
00:05:20,612 --> 00:05:22,948
awak melarikan diri
tanpa hulurkan bantuan.

64
00:05:26,827 --> 00:05:29,704
Lagipun, kami yang tahan perintang tadi

65
00:05:29,705 --> 00:05:31,874
semasa awak ketakutan di belakang.

66
00:05:36,336 --> 00:05:37,546
Itu kerana...

67
00:05:39,048 --> 00:05:40,798
Saya pemimpin.

68
00:05:40,799 --> 00:05:44,052
Jika saya tewas,
siapa nak pimpin kelas kita?

69
00:05:44,053 --> 00:05:47,264
Saya yang temui kawasan selamat ini!

70
00:05:50,559 --> 00:05:51,602
Baiklah.

71
00:05:52,436 --> 00:05:56,732
Kami urus Kondo dan keluarga Ashihara,
walau mereka mungkin raksasa.

72
00:05:57,399 --> 00:06:00,527
Seorang ketua sepatutnya
berada di tempat yang selamat, bukan?

73
00:06:03,572 --> 00:06:07,868
Jika awak mahu berdepan
dengan mereka, silakanlah.

74
00:06:08,452 --> 00:06:13,123
Tetapi jangan benarkan
mereka bertiga masuk walau apa pun jadi.

75
00:06:18,504 --> 00:06:20,630
Dia panggil ini zon selamat,

76
00:06:20,631 --> 00:06:23,383
tapi tiada apa yang selamat.

77
00:06:23,967 --> 00:06:28,137
Hei, Yu, jika ada
Kepala Kon lain menyerang,

78
00:06:28,138 --> 00:06:31,475
perintang itu takkan bertahan
sepuluh saat.

79
00:06:36,563 --> 00:06:37,397
Lagi satu,

80
00:06:38,315 --> 00:06:41,317
itu sahaja pakaian yang awak ada?

81
00:06:41,318 --> 00:06:42,944
Ia cuma baju kalis angin.

82
00:06:42,945 --> 00:06:44,404
Diamlah.

83
00:06:44,988 --> 00:06:47,241
Ashihara, ceritakan apa yang berlaku.

84
00:06:47,825 --> 00:06:49,784
Apa awak buat pada Watamaki?

85
00:06:49,785 --> 00:06:53,038
Jika tak bunuh dia,
bagaimana awak hentikannya?

86
00:06:55,916 --> 00:06:57,042
Saya guna sihir.

87
00:07:17,646 --> 00:07:19,356
Baik, biar saya cuba.

88
00:07:22,151 --> 00:07:23,109
Dah dapat.

89
00:07:23,110 --> 00:07:24,194
Apa?

90
00:07:27,573 --> 00:07:29,574
Jika QREST kami jadi seperti awak,

91
00:07:29,575 --> 00:07:31,784
kami boleh angkat tukul itu?

92
00:07:31,785 --> 00:07:32,828
Mungkin.

93
00:07:33,579 --> 00:07:34,954
Bagaimana caranya?

94
00:07:34,955 --> 00:07:36,706
Perlu bayar?

95
00:07:36,707 --> 00:07:38,333
Tak perlu bayar!

96
00:07:39,084 --> 00:07:40,169
Saya beritahu caranya.

97
00:07:40,836 --> 00:07:44,046
Tapi ini amat penting.

98
00:07:44,047 --> 00:07:45,841
Saya nak jelaskan kepada seluruh kelas.

99
00:07:47,718 --> 00:07:51,013
Baiklah. Saya akan pujuk Gamo.

100
00:08:21,210 --> 00:08:23,754
<i>Jadi, 17 orang selamat.</i>

101
00:08:24,796 --> 00:08:26,339
Di mana yang lain?

102
00:08:26,340 --> 00:08:27,590
Kami tak tahu.

103
00:08:27,591 --> 00:08:31,844
Bukan semua turun
dari Bilik Permainan tingkat dua bersama?

104
00:08:31,845 --> 00:08:34,722
Tidak. Lif tidak berfungsi,

105
00:08:34,723 --> 00:08:36,891
dan tangga sesak sangat.

106
00:08:36,892 --> 00:08:40,270
Mereka di belakang naik ke tingkat tiga.

107
00:08:40,979 --> 00:08:42,689
<i>Yang perempuan ialah Fujikawa</i>

108
00:08:43,565 --> 00:08:44,858
<i>dan Teragami.</i>

109
00:08:45,525 --> 00:08:47,277
<i>Yang lelaki pula ialah Niki,</i>

110
00:08:47,861 --> 00:08:49,738
<i>Haizaki dan kumpulan mereka.</i>

111
00:08:50,405 --> 00:08:51,949
Tingkat ketiga...

112
00:08:53,659 --> 00:08:56,619
Walau ada raksasa di tingkat tiga,

113
00:08:56,620 --> 00:09:00,957
saya rasa Niki atau Haizaki
tidak akan tewas dengan mudah.

114
00:09:00,958 --> 00:09:03,125
Kenapa benarkan mereka masuk?

115
00:09:03,126 --> 00:09:05,587
Apa kita nak buat? Mereka berbahaya.

116
00:09:11,176 --> 00:09:14,804
Awak kata kita boleh tingkatkan QREST.

117
00:09:14,805 --> 00:09:16,098
Bagaimana caranya?

118
00:09:22,688 --> 00:09:25,648
Jangan buang masa. Beritahu sahajalah.

119
00:09:25,649 --> 00:09:28,527
Ya, kami ada urusan lain.

120
00:09:51,341 --> 00:09:54,302
Selepas kami tewaskan
raksasa kepala tajam,

121
00:09:54,303 --> 00:09:56,763
kami periksa di pintu masuk.

122
00:09:57,389 --> 00:10:00,224
Kami cuba pecahkan tingkap,
tapi tidak berjaya.

123
00:10:00,225 --> 00:10:03,728
Sudah tentu budak kerdil
macam awak tak mampu.

124
00:10:03,729 --> 00:10:05,313
Bukan Yu.

125
00:10:05,314 --> 00:10:09,651
Saya ketuk dengan tukul ini,
sedikit pun tak retak.

126
00:10:21,455 --> 00:10:23,081
Saya percayakan kata-katanya.

127
00:10:23,999 --> 00:10:25,249
Si dungu itu.

128
00:10:25,250 --> 00:10:29,338
Bukan tingkap dan pintu automatik sahaja
yang tak boleh dipecahkan.

129
00:10:29,921 --> 00:10:32,340
Semua cermin di lobi gelap-gelita,

130
00:10:32,341 --> 00:10:34,300
jadi kami langsung tak nampak luar,

131
00:10:34,301 --> 00:10:36,303
dan QREST kami
tak bersambung ke rangkaian.

132
00:10:36,928 --> 00:10:41,015
Pendek kata,
selagi punca ini tidak diketahui,

133
00:10:41,016 --> 00:10:43,727
mustahil untuk melarikan diri dari Altea.

134
00:10:51,943 --> 00:10:56,155
Buat masa ini, kita perlu lindungi
tempat perlindungan ini

135
00:10:56,156 --> 00:10:59,283
dan beri semua orang kuasa
untuk melakukannya.

136
00:10:59,284 --> 00:11:00,702
Itu keutamaan kita.

137
00:11:01,203 --> 00:11:03,621
Awak tiada hak untuk menentukannya.

138
00:11:03,622 --> 00:11:06,499
Saya ketua kelas,
dan saya yang jumpa tempat ini.

139
00:11:06,500 --> 00:11:09,878
Jadi, tentulah saya yang perlu
tentukan langkah seterusnya!

140
00:11:11,088 --> 00:11:12,089
Ventus!

141
00:11:23,850 --> 00:11:24,851
Avis!

142
00:11:32,359 --> 00:11:33,527
Ignis!

143
00:11:48,875 --> 00:11:51,795
Itu jampi, bukan?

144
00:11:52,629 --> 00:11:53,879
Daripada Actual Magic.

145
00:11:53,880 --> 00:11:56,591
Mustahil. Itu cuma helah.

146
00:11:57,884 --> 00:11:59,136
Saya tak rasa begitu.

147
00:12:01,054 --> 00:12:03,557
Saya rasa hembusan angin tadi.

148
00:12:04,516 --> 00:12:07,977
QREST tak ada tindak balas sentuhan,

149
00:12:07,978 --> 00:12:11,064
jadi jika terasa angin, itu bukan AR.

150
00:12:11,815 --> 00:12:13,691
Itu bukan helah.

151
00:12:13,692 --> 00:12:15,651
Itu sihir sebenar.

152
00:12:15,652 --> 00:12:20,656
Awak guna sihir
untuk tewaskan raksasa itu?

153
00:12:20,657 --> 00:12:23,659
Bukan makhluk itu sahaja. Watamaki juga.

154
00:12:23,660 --> 00:12:24,910
Tidak.

155
00:12:24,911 --> 00:12:27,288
Kami bunuh raksasa itu.

156
00:12:27,289 --> 00:12:28,415
Tapi Watamaki...

157
00:12:29,666 --> 00:12:31,835
Kami cuma ikat dia agar tidak bergerak.

158
00:12:32,335 --> 00:12:36,673
Saya akan cari jalan
untuk kembalikan Watamaki.

159
00:12:37,174 --> 00:12:38,591
Kembalikan dia seperti asal?

160
00:12:38,592 --> 00:12:40,594
Benarkah ia boleh dilakukan?

161
00:12:41,178 --> 00:12:42,762
Saya rasa mungkin ada caranya.

162
00:12:43,597 --> 00:12:45,098
Tentu ada caranya.

163
00:12:47,184 --> 00:12:48,101
Baiklah.

164
00:12:49,060 --> 00:12:51,896
Ashihara, saya percayakan awak.

165
00:12:51,897 --> 00:12:54,648
Mulai sekarang, saya ikut arahan awak.

166
00:12:54,649 --> 00:12:56,359
Terima kasih, Ohno.

167
00:12:58,195 --> 00:13:02,616
Baiklah. Saya akan ajar kalian guna sihir.

168
00:13:08,955 --> 00:13:11,249
<i>Patutkah saya buat ini?</i>

169
00:13:18,215 --> 00:13:19,299
Yu?

170
00:13:29,059 --> 00:13:31,353
Baiklah, jom kita mula.

171
00:13:42,989 --> 00:13:45,199
Sekarang semua orang telah bertukar

172
00:13:45,200 --> 00:13:48,203
mengikut kelas yang dipilih
semasa ujian Actual Magic.

173
00:13:48,787 --> 00:13:49,787
Biar betul?

174
00:13:49,788 --> 00:13:53,208
{\an8}YOICHI OHNO - HARUKI HOKARI
TAKESHI MORO - TAKATO SERA

175
00:13:53,959 --> 00:13:57,711
Penyihir dan paderi boleh guna jampi,

176
00:13:57,712 --> 00:14:00,047
pahlawan sepatutnya menjadi lebih kuat,

177
00:14:00,048 --> 00:14:02,842
manakala pencuri
dan pemburu bergerak lebih pantas.

178
00:14:11,685 --> 00:14:12,894
Ashihara.

179
00:14:13,520 --> 00:14:16,063
Maaf sebab anggap awak
seperti raksasa tadi.

180
00:14:16,064 --> 00:14:18,691
Tak, saya tak salahkan awak.

181
00:14:18,692 --> 00:14:20,025
Tapi saya rasa terseksa.

182
00:14:20,026 --> 00:14:22,069
Jika kita tahu lebih awal,

183
00:14:22,070 --> 00:14:25,031
mungkin kita dapat selamatkan Beroshi.

184
00:14:28,368 --> 00:14:31,078
Kenapa awak ketawa?

185
00:14:31,079 --> 00:14:33,622
Apa lagi yang boleh saya buat?
Kalah tetap kalah.

186
00:14:33,623 --> 00:14:35,332
Kumpulan mereka lebih hebat.

187
00:14:35,333 --> 00:14:36,792
Tapi...

188
00:14:36,793 --> 00:14:39,128
Jangan risau, Yoi.

189
00:14:39,129 --> 00:14:42,590
Suatu hari nanti,
saya akan jadi pengawal terbaik liga

190
00:14:42,591 --> 00:14:44,633
dan bantu awak menangi perlawanan.

191
00:14:44,634 --> 00:14:45,927
Beroshi.

192
00:14:47,137 --> 00:14:48,679
Dengar sini, pemain simpanan!

193
00:14:48,680 --> 00:14:51,182
Saya kapten dan tiada siapa
boleh memperlekehkan saya!

194
00:14:53,893 --> 00:14:55,186
Semuanya baik, bukan?

195
00:15:00,150 --> 00:15:01,484
Beroshi!

196
00:15:02,152 --> 00:15:04,863
Pergi! Yoi!

197
00:15:05,363 --> 00:15:06,823
Ohno!

198
00:15:13,913 --> 00:15:16,165
Beroshi selamatkan kita semua.

199
00:15:16,166 --> 00:15:18,376
Kita perlu keluar dengan selamat demi dia.

200
00:15:20,170 --> 00:15:21,420
Dengar sini sebentar.

201
00:15:21,421 --> 00:15:25,425
Sesiapa di sini yang memilih kelas paderi,
sila angkat tangan.

202
00:15:26,926 --> 00:15:28,053
Saya.

203
00:15:31,056 --> 00:15:32,474
Saya juga!

204
00:15:33,933 --> 00:15:35,560
Jangan berlagak.

205
00:15:36,061 --> 00:15:38,020
Hanya tiga?

206
00:15:38,021 --> 00:15:40,648
Ya. Kurang daripada jangkaan saya.

207
00:15:40,649 --> 00:15:42,274
Shimizu, Soga

208
00:15:42,275 --> 00:15:45,653
dan Moro patut boleh guna sihir penyembuh.

209
00:15:45,654 --> 00:15:48,114
Saya mahu kamu merawat mangsa cedera.

210
00:15:49,032 --> 00:15:51,951
Yalah. Kita boleh
sembuhkan mereka guna sihir.

211
00:15:56,289 --> 00:15:57,123
Moro.

212
00:15:58,291 --> 00:15:59,542
Ya?

213
00:16:01,211 --> 00:16:04,380
Tolong sembuhkan Tada dan Aida.

214
00:16:04,381 --> 00:16:06,841
Beroshi korbankan nyawa demi mereka.

215
00:16:08,134 --> 00:16:10,094
Ohno minta bantuan Mo-yan?

216
00:16:10,095 --> 00:16:11,763
Saya tak percaya.

217
00:16:13,640 --> 00:16:16,101
Okey. Saya akan cuba.

218
00:16:19,104 --> 00:16:20,730
Mo-yan sangat hebat!

219
00:16:21,606 --> 00:16:23,692
Apa jampinya tadi?

220
00:16:24,609 --> 00:16:26,569
Biar betul?

221
00:16:33,201 --> 00:16:34,202
Sacre!

222
00:16:40,166 --> 00:16:41,042
Premis!

223
00:16:43,628 --> 00:16:46,965
Fusione! Penyembuhan Suci!

224
00:16:58,852 --> 00:17:00,061
Tak sakit.

225
00:17:01,229 --> 00:17:02,771
Ada rasa sakit sedikit.

226
00:17:02,772 --> 00:17:04,190
Kejap, yang mana satu?

227
00:17:05,775 --> 00:17:07,610
Saya okey.

228
00:17:08,570 --> 00:17:10,071
Sihir memang menakjubkan!

229
00:17:10,697 --> 00:17:12,197
Kita berjaya!

230
00:17:12,198 --> 00:17:14,032
Pesakit seterusnya!

231
00:17:14,033 --> 00:17:16,786
Awak seperti doktor pula, bukannya paderi.

232
00:17:21,666 --> 00:17:23,418
Rasa sakit betul-betul hilang!

233
00:17:23,960 --> 00:17:25,962
Okey, bertenang!

234
00:17:27,547 --> 00:17:29,381
Awak hebat, Mo-yan!

235
00:17:29,382 --> 00:17:30,633
Saya tak percaya!

236
00:17:32,469 --> 00:17:35,512
Mulai hari ini, panggil saya Paderi Agung.

237
00:17:35,513 --> 00:17:37,055
Jangan berlagak.

238
00:17:37,056 --> 00:17:39,308
Itu sangat menakjubkan.

239
00:17:39,309 --> 00:17:41,310
Beri saya petua nanti, ya?

240
00:17:41,311 --> 00:17:43,061
Saya juga.

241
00:17:43,062 --> 00:17:44,856
Syabas, Moro!

242
00:17:45,440 --> 00:17:46,482
Kalian...

243
00:17:46,483 --> 00:17:48,526
Kami harapkan awak, Paderi Agung!

244
00:17:49,652 --> 00:17:50,944
Ya!

245
00:17:50,945 --> 00:17:52,113
Yu!

246
00:17:55,325 --> 00:17:56,701
Apa itu?

247
00:18:10,465 --> 00:18:12,133
Yu, kekalkan di situ!

248
00:18:24,187 --> 00:18:26,064
Apa? Adakah ia berkesan?

249
00:18:26,689 --> 00:18:28,316
Itu kerosakan percikan.

250
00:18:29,901 --> 00:18:33,488
Serangga ini mudah tewas
jika diketuk benda keras...

251
00:18:40,912 --> 00:18:43,413
Kita perlu uruskannya sendiri.

252
00:18:43,414 --> 00:18:45,582
Sawa, tendang cacing-cacing itu.

253
00:18:45,583 --> 00:18:47,668
Konken, hancurkannya guna tukul.

254
00:18:47,669 --> 00:18:48,919
Baik!

255
00:18:48,920 --> 00:18:50,088
Awak pula?

256
00:18:50,588 --> 00:18:52,340
Saya buat apa yang mampu guna ini.

257
00:18:58,555 --> 00:19:01,975
LARVA LALAT NERAKA TABANUS

258
00:19:04,060 --> 00:19:05,061
Kita boleh!

259
00:19:14,821 --> 00:19:16,573
<i>Tinggal tujuh atau lapan ekor lagi.</i>

260
00:19:20,702 --> 00:19:23,453
Ashihara! Bantu Ruki!

261
00:19:23,454 --> 00:19:25,498
Tolong! Lekas!

262
00:19:35,133 --> 00:19:37,384
TAHAP 8 > 9
MATA STATUS +3 - MATA KEMAHIRAN +40

263
00:19:37,385 --> 00:19:38,719
Dah berakhir.

264
00:19:38,720 --> 00:19:40,387
Ruki!

265
00:19:40,388 --> 00:19:41,638
Mungkin racun.

266
00:19:41,639 --> 00:19:43,348
Adakah dia akan mati?

267
00:19:43,349 --> 00:19:45,851
Tak, kemungkinan besar
ia racun untuk melumpuhkan.

268
00:19:45,852 --> 00:19:47,145
Tunggu sebentar.

269
00:19:47,687 --> 00:19:50,355
Ashihara, Tomori...

270
00:19:50,356 --> 00:19:53,734
Tomochi telah melindungi saya,

271
00:19:53,735 --> 00:19:56,361
dan saya cuma mampu melarikan diri.

272
00:19:56,362 --> 00:19:58,822
Bukan salah awak, Tsuda.

273
00:19:58,823 --> 00:20:01,284
Saya pun tak mampu buat apa-apa.

274
00:20:01,910 --> 00:20:04,620
Soga, awak boleh guna jampi penawar?

275
00:20:04,621 --> 00:20:06,830
Ya. Rasanyalah.

276
00:20:06,831 --> 00:20:09,666
Kalau begitu, cuba pada Shimizu.

277
00:20:09,667 --> 00:20:10,960
Okey.

278
00:20:12,128 --> 00:20:13,171
Sacre.

279
00:20:13,880 --> 00:20:14,964
Pluvia.

280
00:20:16,382 --> 00:20:17,592
Tersus.

281
00:20:18,885 --> 00:20:21,554
Penyucian Suci!

282
00:20:30,647 --> 00:20:32,357
Tomochi!

283
00:20:32,899 --> 00:20:34,650
Terima kasih, Soga.

284
00:20:34,651 --> 00:20:36,693
Terima kasih, Ashihara.

285
00:20:36,694 --> 00:20:37,903
Sama-sama.

286
00:20:37,904 --> 00:20:39,780
Yang penting, setelah boleh bergerak,

287
00:20:39,781 --> 00:20:41,323
saya nak awak dan Soga berpecah

288
00:20:41,324 --> 00:20:43,700
dan sembuhkan semua yang lumpuh.

289
00:20:43,701 --> 00:20:45,620
Baik. Saya dah okey.

290
00:20:46,329 --> 00:20:47,663
Di mana Moro?

291
00:20:47,664 --> 00:20:50,040
Moro tiada di sini!

292
00:20:50,041 --> 00:20:52,417
Ashihara, di sana.

293
00:20:52,418 --> 00:20:54,837
KAKITANGAN SAHAJA

294
00:21:08,017 --> 00:21:09,227
Mo-yan?

295
00:21:11,646 --> 00:21:13,313
Apa itu?

296
00:21:13,314 --> 00:21:15,108
Adakah itu kepompong?

297
00:21:16,651 --> 00:21:17,694
Konken, hancurkan ia!

298
00:21:22,365 --> 00:21:24,658
LALAT NERAKA TABANUS

299
00:21:24,659 --> 00:21:28,203
Sepuluh saat lagi, ia pasti menetas.

300
00:21:28,204 --> 00:21:30,163
Awak okey, Moro?

301
00:21:30,164 --> 00:21:32,207
Awak selamat sekarang.

302
00:21:32,208 --> 00:21:36,128
Shimizu atau Soga
boleh sembuhkan awak segera.

303
00:21:36,129 --> 00:21:38,089
Awak boleh bangun, Mo-yan?

304
00:21:46,681 --> 00:21:47,849
Kenapa?

305
00:21:48,558 --> 00:21:49,767
Dia dah mati!

306
00:23:27,990 --> 00:23:28,907
IBLIS

307
00:23:28,908 --> 00:23:30,158
<i>Lindungi mereka.</i>

308
00:23:30,159 --> 00:23:31,618
<i>Kita tak perlu sebanyak ini.</i>

309
00:23:31,619 --> 00:23:34,830
<i>Siapa beri awak hak
untuk mengarah-arah kami?</i>

310
00:23:34,831 --> 00:23:35,956
<i>Nisbah meningkat.</i>

311
00:23:35,957 --> 00:23:36,957
<i>Saya nampak.</i>

312
00:23:36,958 --> 00:23:39,251
<i>Selepas itu, dia bantu Sera dan Hokari.</i>

313
00:23:39,252 --> 00:23:40,794
<i>Ada yang tak kena di sini!</i>

314
00:23:40,795 --> 00:23:43,004
<i>Gembira bertemu awak, Yuumy.</i>

315
00:23:43,005 --> 00:23:44,089
Terjemahan sari kata oleh Shazreena

316
00:23:44,090 --> 00:23:45,091
Penyelia Kreatif
H. Segara

